{
  "name": "Domain portfolio expiry tracker with Google Sheets and email alerts (Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6e174b87-a8f8-43df-b027-a14b9fd3b056",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 740,
        "content": "## Domain portfolio expiry tracker (Google Sheets + email)\n\n**Who it's for:** agencies, IT admins and domain investors who manage many domains for themselves or clients and cannot afford a forgotten renewal.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Every Monday at 8:00 the workflow reads the domain list from your Google Sheet.\n2. All domains go in one call to the Domain Availability Checker Actor on Apify, which reads official RDAP/WHOIS registry data (registrar, expiry date, status).\n3. A Code node calculates days left and labels each domain `ok`, `renew soon`, `expired` or `not registered`.\n4. The sheet is updated, so it always shows the current registrar, expiry date and status.\n5. Domains that need attention are grouped into one email. Weeks with nothing to do send nothing.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Apify account (free plan works). In **Check domains on Apify** add an *HTTP Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Sheet headers: domain, status, registrar, expiresAt, daysLeft, lastChecked. Pick it in **Read domains** and **Update domain row**.\n3. In **Settings**, set `warnDays` and your alert email; connect Gmail.\n\n**Note:** some ccTLDs (e.g. .es, .ch) do not publish expiry dates; they are reported without a date.\n\n**Cost:** $0.0015 per domain checked on Apify; 50 domains every week is about $0.30 per month."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3402cee7-b8f3-47ff-a58c-2e6f228b044d",
      "name": "Section: read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "### 1. Read and check\nOne Apify call for the whole list, capped at $1 per run.",
        "color": "5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "12d4979c-9e9a-4e03-96fd-4c7aac3e7830",
      "name": "Section: label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 660,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "### 2. Label and save\nDays left are calculated in n8n, then every row is written back to the sheet.",
        "color": "6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ea126e5e-a2c0-4914-bff8-9e44cea60eb7",
      "name": "Section: alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "### 3. Alert\nOnly domains that are expiring, expired or no longer registered reach your inbox.",
        "color": "4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b5ba7145-1b97-4177-8860-c9b31cf6eacb",
      "name": "Every Monday 8:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        100,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a30acd12-cf72-4c53-852d-6e8211599d22",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        300,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"warnDays\": 45,\n  \"alertEmail\": \"you@example.com\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "38bc5212-428a-43dc-a044-222c90c00055",
      "name": "Read domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        500,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1b971e3c-049d-488a-88bb-6dec3cf9b19d",
      "name": "Collect domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const domains = [...new Set($input.all().map(i => String(i.json.domain || '').trim().toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean))];\nif (!domains.length) return [];\nreturn [{ json: { domains } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5eed3051-6557-4ed2-b7c5-c1bdf2b78aa7",
      "name": "Check domains on Apify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1060,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/uianalize~domain-availability-checker/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: $json.domains }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6ff61cab-2239-4475-a8ab-72ea676d2fe0",
      "name": "Label each domain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const warn = $('Settings').first().json.warnDays || 45;\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nreturn $input.all().map(({ json: d }) => {\n  const days = d.expiresAt ? Math.floor((new Date(d.expiresAt) - Date.now()) / 86400000) : null;\n  let status = 'ok';\n  if (d.status === 'available') status = 'not registered';\n  else if (d.status === 'likely-available') status = 'probably not registered';\n  else if (d.status === 'unknown') status = 'unknown';\n  else if (days !== null && days < 0) status = 'expired';\n  else if (days !== null && days <= warn) status = 'renew soon';\n  return { json: {\n    domain: d.domain,\n    status,\n    registrar: d.registrar || '',\n    expiresAt: d.expiresAt ? String(d.expiresAt).slice(0, 10) : '',\n    daysLeft: days ?? '',\n    lastChecked: today,\n  } };\n});"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "85b1ed71-0c59-447c-8063-f7944440358f",
      "name": "Update domain row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1500,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "domain"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14b53abf-3ee4-4b6a-a258-9d38bc77feef",
      "name": "Needs attention",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "0c892b57-4652-426e-b972-d7a2a31b696b",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "ok",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "82d12b53-08a0-470e-8b34-2d89ccf6f5ba",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "unknown",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0c05948d-a5fc-4984-8a00-88ba2b5d9b5e",
      "name": "Build email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1680,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).sort((a, b) => (a.daysLeft === '' ? 1e9 : a.daysLeft) - (b.daysLeft === '' ? 1e9 : b.daysLeft));\nif (!rows.length) return [];\nconst lines = rows.map(r => r.status.endsWith('not registered')\n  ? `- ${r.domain}: ${r.status.toUpperCase()}`\n  : `- ${r.domain}: ${r.status}, expires ${r.expiresAt} (${r.daysLeft} days), registrar ${r.registrar || 'unknown'}`);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  to: $('Settings').first().json.alertEmail,\n  subject: `${rows.length} domain(s) need attention`,\n  body: `Domain expiry check:\\n\\n${lines.join('\\n')}`,\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d9937528-c342-4572-80dd-6b3d86a97588",
      "name": "Email the alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1860,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.to }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
